%N A399329 The binomial matrix of the LCM of {1, 2, ..., n}. Square array read by ascending antidiagonals.
%C A399329 See the comments and links in A399000.
%H A399329 Peter Luschny, <a href="https://github.com/PeterLuschny/Gists/blob/main/GnomonicExpansionAndBinomialMatrices.ipynb">Gnomonic Expansion and Binomial Matrices</a>, a Python notebook.
%F A399329 A(n, n) = L(n) := LCM({1, 2, ..., n}), A003418.
%F A399329 A(n, k) = Sum_{m=0..d} binomial(d, m) * s^(d - m) * L(p + m), where d = abs(n - k), p = min(n, k), s = 1 if k <= n, otherwise -1.
